REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_VAULT_PASSWORD
# Copy this file to `.vault_pass` (which is git-ignored) and put the real
# Ansible Vault password on the first line. Then either:
#   - uncomment `vault_password_file = .vault_pass` in ansible.cfg, or
#   - pass `--vault-password-file .vault_pass` on each ansible-playbook run.
# NEVER commit the real .vault_pass.
